---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
import WikiCard from '../components/WikiCard.astro';
import { ingredientEntities } from '../data/entities';
import { siteImages } from '../data/images';
---
<ContentPage title="Karinderya Ingredients" description="Explore Karinderya ingredients, grocery listings, and related customer orders." kicker="Ingredient index" intro="Browse grocery ingredients and the customer orders that use them." relatedLinks={[{ label: 'Grocery prices', href: '/grocery/' }, { label: 'Customer orders', href: '/recipes/' }, { label: 'Food menu', href: '/food/' }]} sourceIds={['codex-menu', 'wiki-menu', 'wiki-money']} heroImage={siteImages.ingredientsHero} tableOfContents>
  <h2 id="ingredient-overview">Ingredient Overview</h2>
  <p>The ingredient index contains Rice, Condiments, Eggs, Vegetables, Bangus, Pork, and Beef. Each database page brings together its grocery listing and any related customer-order information currently covered by the wiki.</p>
  <h3 id="documented-ingredient-pages">Ingredient Pages</h3>
  <div class="card-grid">{ingredientEntities.map((item) => <WikiCard title={item.title.replace('Karinderya ', '')} description={item.description} href={`/ingredients/${item.slug}/`} icon={item.title.charAt(11)} />)}</div>

  <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>
  <p>Rice and Condiments appear in both customer tickets listed here. Egg appears in one of those tickets. Vegetables, Bangus, Pork, and Beef are included in the grocery ingredient list.</p>

  <h2 id="related-orders">Related Orders</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/recipes/">Recipes and Orders page</a> lists customer-ticket combinations covered by the wiki.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Rice + Condiments</li>
    <li>Rice + Egg + Condiments</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="grocery-availability">Grocery Availability</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/grocery/">Grocery page</a> provides the combined list of ingredient categories and shop listings. Individual ingredient pages provide a quicker route to the information for Rice, Condiments, Eggs, Vegetables, Bangus, Pork, and Beef.</p>
</ContentPage>
